  "aggregation": "nearest-rank quantiles; paired run statistic deltas; worst per-run boundary crossing is INCONCLUSIVE rather than a false PASS. No outlier removal.",
  "note": "Targets, not product measurements. Counter metrics require real instrumented sources and review; numbers are recalculated, not authenticated.",
  "policy_notes": [
    "P01 uses two actual build manifests, not repeated fabricated timing pairs.",
    "P03 must satisfy its unchanged absolute SLO AND <=max(5% baseline, 2ms input-p95/feedback or 5ms input-p99/hot-tab). These are engineering limits, not measured noise. S02 tests repeatability; excessive noise is inconclusive, never a license to widen budgets.",
    "residual_slope is signed bytes/min. Nonpositive estimates pass the zero-growth limit; mixed signs are INCONCLUSIVE, sustained positive estimates FAIL. No rounding to zero or outlier removal; extend settle/window to resolve noise. Residual byte ceiling remains unchanged."
  ]
